WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.365 --> 00:00:15.667
&gt;&gt; WE NEED TO BE ABLE TO DO OUR

00:00:15.122 --> 00:00:16.725
JOB AND GET TO THE BOTTOM OF

00:00:15.791 --> 00:00:18.677
THESE ACCUSATIONS TO FIND OUT IF

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:20.427
THEY ARE TRUE.

00:00:18.827 --> 00:00:21.428
PRESCRIPTION DRUGS, HANDING OUT

00:00:20.572 --> 00:00:23.380
LIKE IT WAS CANDY OR WHETHER IT

00:00:21.573 --> 00:00:23.799
WAS INTOXICATION OR A TOXIC WORK

00:00:23.546 --> 00:00:25.584
ENVIRONMENT.

00:00:23.931 --> 00:00:27.786
&gt;&gt; HE DESERVES HIS DAY IN COURT.

00:00:25.733 --> 00:00:28.584
I ASSUME THE COMMITTEE WILL GIVE

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:29.337
HIM THAT.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:32.690
IT'S TROUBLING TO A LOT OF US.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:33.667
&gt;&gt; DR. JACKSON HAS HAD AT LEAST

00:00:32.838 --> 00:00:34.593
FOUR INDEPENDENT BACKGROUND

00:00:33.785 --> 00:00:36.595
INVESTIGATIONS CONDUCTED DURING

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:37.671
HIS TIME AT THE WHITE HOUSE

00:00:36.743 --> 00:00:38.743
INCLUDING AN FBI INVESTIGATION

00:00:37.789 --> 00:00:40.391
CONDUCTED AS PART OF THE

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:40.797
STANDARD NOMINATION VETTING

00:00:40.499 --> 00:00:43.002
PROCESS.

00:00:40.947 --> 00:00:44.504
DURING EACH OF THOSE

00:00:43.173 --> 00:00:46.402
INVESTIGATIONS, DR. JACKSON

00:00:44.675 --> 00:00:47.799
RECEIVED UNANIMOUS PRAISE FROM

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:49.105
DOZENS OF WITNESSES, AND THE

00:00:47.903 --> 00:00:49.505
INVESTIGATIONS REVEALED NO AREAS

00:00:49.255 --> 00:00:52.259
OF CONCERN.

00:00:49.655 --> 00:00:55.206
&gt;&gt; Bret: AS OF TONIGHT, RONNY

00:00:52.403 --> 00:00:56.863
JACKSON IS STILL THE NOMINEE FOR

00:00:55.329 --> 00:00:59.082
VETERANS AFFAIRS SECRETARY, AND

00:00:57.008 --> 00:01:00.211
THE WHITE HOUSE PRESS SAYING TO

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.012
GET A CONFIRMATION PROCESS

00:01:00.337 --> 00:01:03.119
STARTED AGAIN ON CAPITOL HILL.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.443
LET'S BRING IN THE PANEL.

00:01:03.288 --> 00:01:07.024
CHARLES HURT, OPINION WRITER FOR

00:01:06.573 --> 00:01:07.819
"THE WASHINGTON TIMES."

00:01:07.194 --> 00:01:09.420
MO ELLEITHEE, EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR

00:01:07.925 --> 00:01:09.776
OF THE GEORGETOWN INSTITUTE OF

00:01:09.525 --> 00:01:11.623
POLITICS.

00:01:09.921 --> 00:01:14.225
JONATHAN SWAN, NATIONAL

00:01:11.728 --> 00:01:15.832
POLITICAL REPORTER FOR AXIOS.

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:18.830
JONATHAN, IS THE WHITE HOUSE

00:01:15.981 --> 00:01:19.931
FIRM IN THE PUSHBACK, SEEMS SO.

00:01:18.936 --> 00:01:21.633
BEHIND THE SCENES, ARE THEY

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:22.389
SAYING THE SAME THING?

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:25.111
&gt;&gt; THE WHITE HOUSE IS CONFLICTED

00:01:22.533 --> 00:01:26.995
IN THE SENSE THAT THEY ALMOST

00:01:25.236 --> 00:01:28.439
UNANIMOUSLY, I HAVE YET TO FIND

00:01:27.138 --> 00:01:31.616
ANYONE WHO DOESN'T THINK HE'S A

00:01:28.545 --> 00:01:32.618
GOOD MAN WHO IS BEING UNFAIRLY

00:01:31.743 --> 00:01:34.152
-- ALLEGATIONS ARE OUT THERE.

00:01:32.744 --> 00:01:34.646
WE DON'T KNOW IF THEY ARE TRUE

00:01:34.301 --> 00:01:36.648
OR NOT.

00:01:34.752 --> 00:01:38.456
SOME OF THEM HAVE BECOME

00:01:36.755 --> 00:01:40.760
PERSONALLY, THOSE CLOSE TO HIM

00:01:38.624 --> 00:01:42.009
FEEL UPSET TO SEE THIS HAPPENING

00:01:40.909 --> 00:01:42.954
TO A GUY THEY CONSIDER TO BE A

00:01:42.153 --> 00:01:44.255
GOOD MAN.

00:01:43.058 --> 00:01:45.356
ON THE OTHER SIDE, IT'S VERY

00:01:44.389 --> 00:01:46.062
HARD TO FIND A SENIOR

00:01:45.461 --> 00:01:48.013
WHITE HOUSE OFFICIAL WHO THINKS

00:01:46.217 --> 00:01:51.570
THAT HE'S THE RIGHT SELECTION

00:01:48.159 --> 00:01:53.420
FOR THE JOB.

00:01:51.718 --> 00:01:55.171
AND BELIEFS TRUMP UNANNOUNCED

00:01:53.564 --> 00:01:57.769
HIM IN THE CORRECT WAY.

00:01:55.322 --> 00:01:58.399
TRUMP TWEETED IT OUT WITHOUT ANY

00:01:57.898 --> 00:02:00.626
VETTING OVER JOHN KELLY'S

00:01:58.524 --> 00:02:02.380
OBJECTIONS AND ALMOST NO ONE IN

00:02:00.772 --> 00:02:02.774
SENIOR STAFF THAT THAT WAS A

00:02:02.529 --> 00:02:04.582
GOOD IDEA.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:06.985
&gt;&gt; Bret: SARAH'S POINT IS THAT

00:02:04.732 --> 00:02:08.718
HE HAD BEEN VETTED FOR HIS JOB

00:02:07.134 --> 00:02:10.987
AS PHYSICIAN TO THE PRESIDENT.

00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:12.789
VERY CLOSELY.

00:02:11.137 --> 00:02:13.110
THE FBI CHECKS AND ALL THAT

00:02:12.938 --> 00:02:15.610
STUFF.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.745
&gt;&gt; DOCTOR TO THE PRESIDENT IS

00:02:15.745 --> 00:02:17.946
QUITE DIFFERENT FROM RUNNING THE

00:02:16.888 --> 00:02:18.843
SECOND LARGEST AGENCY AND THE

00:02:18.089 --> 00:02:20.397
FEDERAL GOVERNMENT.

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.592
HE HAS NO MANAGEMENT EXPERIENCE

00:02:20.548 --> 00:02:22.197
THAT WOULD BE RELEVANT FOR THAT

00:02:21.697 --> 00:02:23.070
JOB.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.601
THAT'S THEIR CONCERN.

00:02:23.194 --> 00:02:26.197
I THINK THIS IS ALL NEW

00:02:24.752 --> 00:02:26.698
INFORMATION FOR THEM AND THEY

00:02:26.321 --> 00:02:27.804
ARE ABSORBING IT.

00:02:26.826 --> 00:02:28.405
THEY DON'T KNOW WHAT TO MAKE OF

00:02:27.973 --> 00:02:31.609
IT.

00:02:28.556 --> 00:02:32.308
FOR THE MOMENT, THEY ARE ON A

00:02:31.758 --> 00:02:34.011
FLAT FOOT.

00:02:32.477 --> 00:02:35.762
&gt;&gt; Bret: TWO DIFFERENT SIDES.

00:02:34.161 --> 00:02:38.109
ONE IS THAT THE WHITE HOUSE PUTS

00:02:35.907 --> 00:02:39.165
SOMEONE OUT THAT PERHAPS, WITH

00:02:38.233 --> 00:02:40.916
THE ALLEGATIONS BACK THERE AND

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:41.612
THEY KNOW ABOUT ITS END AND IT

00:02:41.066 --> 00:02:43.623
COMES OUT.

00:02:41.738 --> 00:02:45.316
THE OTHER SIDE'S DEMOCRATS IN

00:02:43.771 --> 00:02:48.074
THE MINORITY PUT OUT THE PRESS

00:02:45.422 --> 00:02:51.422
THESE ALLEGATIONS THAT PUBLICLY

00:02:48.219 --> 00:02:52.623
SAY THEY DON'T KNOW ARE TRUE.

00:02:51.531 --> 00:02:54.130
THE MINORITY SAYING MULTIPLE

00:02:52.764 --> 00:02:55.026
INDIVIDUALS CITING THE NICKNAME

00:02:54.276 --> 00:02:56.932
CANDYMAN USED BY THE WHITE HOUSE

00:02:55.128 --> 00:02:58.229
STAFF BECAUSE HE WOULD PROVIDE

00:02:57.079 --> 00:03:01.518
WHATEVER PRESCRIPTIONS THEY

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:06.537
SOUGHT WITHOUT PAPERWORK.

00:03:01.933 --> 00:03:08.391
DESCRIBING HANDING OUT AMBIEN TO

00:03:07.274 --> 00:03:09.792
SLEEP.

00:03:08.539 --> 00:03:10.393
WITHOUT TRIAGING PATIENT

00:03:09.941 --> 00:03:11.142
HISTORY.

00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:14.199
NO INTAKES, NO QUESTIONNAIRES.

00:03:11.278 --> 00:03:15.402
I CAN TELL YOU PERSONALLY I WAS

00:03:14.345 --> 00:03:16.799
CHIEF WHITE HOUSE CORRESPONDENT.

00:03:15.546 --> 00:03:17.283
I TOOK AMBIEN FROM DOCTORS ON

00:03:16.948 --> 00:03:21.404
TRIPS OVERSEAS.

00:03:17.401 --> 00:03:22.805
THESE ARE CONTROLLED SUBSTANCES

00:03:21.552 --> 00:03:24.162
THAT REQUIRE TRACKING.

00:03:22.954 --> 00:03:26.357
ON ONE OCCASION DR. JACKSON

00:03:24.307 --> 00:03:27.560
COULD NOT BE REACHED WHEN NEEDED

00:03:26.461 --> 00:03:31.062
BECAUSE HE WAS PASSED OUT DRUNK.

00:03:27.713 --> 00:03:33.045
AT A SECRET SERVICE PARTY,

00:03:31.169 --> 00:03:33.821
JACKSON GOT DRUNK AND WRECKED A

00:03:33.164 --> 00:03:34.665
VEHICLE.

00:03:33.965 --> 00:03:35.221
JACKSON DENIES THOSE THINGS

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.610
VEHEMENTLY.

00:03:35.366 --> 00:03:38.376
AS FAR AS THE PASSING OUT OF

00:03:37.724 --> 00:03:39.626
AMBIEN, UNLESS IT'S SOMETHING

00:03:38.523 --> 00:03:42.028
BIGGER OR MORE SERIOUS AS FAR AS

00:03:39.771 --> 00:03:43.028
THE DRUGS, THAT HAPPENS ALL THE

00:03:42.173 --> 00:03:46.783
TIME.

00:03:43.174 --> 00:03:47.285
&gt;&gt; YOU RAISED TWO GOOD

00:03:46.934 --> 00:03:49.408
QUESTIONS, RIGHT?

00:03:47.433 --> 00:03:50.836
DEMOCRATS COULD HAVE BROUGHT

00:03:49.537 --> 00:03:52.157
THIS UP IN A DIFFERENT WAY.

00:03:50.982 --> 00:03:53.239
A PRODUCT TO THE WHITE HOUSE,

00:03:52.283 --> 00:03:55.841
SAID THIS IS WHAT WE ARE SEEING

00:03:53.384 --> 00:03:56.414
AND WE ARE GOING TO ASK ABOUT

00:03:55.987 --> 00:03:57.994
THIS IN A HEARING.

00:03:56.543 --> 00:03:59.196
THEY COULD HAVE DONE THAT.

00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:01.948
THE SECOND ISSUE WOULDN'T HAPPEN

00:03:59.345 --> 00:04:02.247
TO HAVE THE FIRST ONE NOT HAPPEN

00:04:02.093 --> 00:04:03.669
FIRST.

00:04:02.393 --> 00:04:05.671
THE FACT THAT THE PRESIDENT DID

00:04:03.795 --> 00:04:07.437
NOT VET, THE WHITE HOUSE DID NOT

00:04:05.797 --> 00:04:08.853
VET HIM OR THEY WOULD'VE CAUGHT

00:04:07.553 --> 00:04:10.501
THAT THERE WERE 20 ALLEGATIONS.

00:04:10.608 --> 00:04:14.205
CAUGHT IT AND PREPPED FOR IT AND

00:04:12.303 --> 00:04:16.013
THEY WOULD'VE ADDRESSED IT ON

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.483
THE FRONT-END.

00:04:16.162 --> 00:04:18.164
IT FITS A NARRATIVE AND A TRACK

00:04:17.608 --> 00:04:20.238
RECORD OF THIS WHITE HOUSE OF

00:04:18.309 --> 00:04:20.619
BEING LESS THAN CAREFUL WITH

00:04:20.366 --> 00:04:21.712
VETTING.

00:04:20.767 --> 00:04:24.215
I DON'T THINK EITHER SIDE PUT

00:04:21.817 --> 00:04:25.817
ITS BEST FOOT FORWARD BUT I

00:04:24.321 --> 00:04:27.919
THINK THE WHITE HOUSE CERTAINLY

00:04:25.922 --> 00:04:28.619
CAUSED THIS PROBLEM BY NOT DOING

00:04:28.024 --> 00:04:31.677
BASIC VETTING.

00:04:28.745 --> 00:04:33.024
&gt;&gt; Bret: WHICH WAS MY POINT IN

00:04:31.823 --> 00:04:34.228
SAYING, CHARLIE, BOTH SIDES

00:04:33.131 --> 00:04:35.933
COULD DO THINGS DIFFERENTLY.

00:04:34.379 --> 00:04:37.332
THE DEMOCRATS COULD HAVE REACHED

00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:37.682
OUT AND SAID THIS IS WHAT WE ARE

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:38.903
HEARING.

00:04:37.829 --> 00:04:41.432
WHAT DO YOU KNOW ABOUT IT OR

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:42.540
LET'S MOVE FORWARD WITH THE

00:04:41.539 --> 00:04:42.834
HEARING IF YOU WANT TO ADDRESS

00:04:42.689 --> 00:04:44.435
IT.

00:04:42.939 --> 00:04:45.436
&gt;&gt; IF ALL THESE ALLEGATIONS OR

00:04:44.542 --> 00:04:48.415
ANY OF THE ALLEGATIONS ARE TRUE,

00:04:45.542 --> 00:04:50.166
IT SORT OF REFLECTS MORE POORLY

00:04:48.539 --> 00:04:50.947
OVER TIME ON THE PREVIOUS

00:04:50.296 --> 00:04:52.097
ADMINISTRATION THAT IT DOES ON

00:04:51.098 --> 00:04:53.249
THE CURRENT ADMINISTRATION THAT

00:04:52.243 --> 00:04:54.350
ALL OF THESE TERRIBLE THINGS

00:04:53.422 --> 00:04:58.249
WERE GOING ON INSIDE THE

00:04:54.500 --> 00:05:00.251
WHITE HOUSE ON FOREIGN TRIPS.

00:04:58.354 --> 00:05:00.708
UNDER THE PREVIOUS

00:05:00.356 --> 00:05:02.207
ADMINISTRATION.

00:05:00.852 --> 00:05:04.755
THAT SAID, THE PRESIDENT DOES

00:05:02.353 --> 00:05:05.412
HAVE A HABIT OF CROSSING THE

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.292
STREET WITHOUT LOOKING BOTH

00:05:05.556 --> 00:05:08.834
WAYS.

00:05:06.412 --> 00:05:10.265
BUT IT WORKS FOR HIM.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:19.995
AND I THINK THE ACCUSATIONS THAT

00:05:10.415 --> 00:05:20.571
THIS GUY IS NOT QUALIFIED TO RUN

00:05:20.126 --> 00:05:20.999
SUCH A LARGE, COMPLEX

00:05:20.676 --> 00:05:21.528
ORGANIZATION.

00:05:21.126 --> 00:05:22.273
MY GOODNESS, WHO IS?

00:05:21.672 --> 00:05:22.929
THE PREVIOUS PERSON IN THAT SPOT

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:24.075
HAD A LOT OF EXPERIENCE WITH

00:05:23.074 --> 00:05:24.976
MANAGEMENT AND HE WAS A

00:05:24.752 --> 00:05:26.033
DISASTER.

00:05:25.376 --> 00:05:28.335
THAT GOES TO THE NATURE, IF YOU

00:05:26.177 --> 00:05:28.933
ASK ME COME OUT OF THE WHOLE

00:05:28.479 --> 00:05:29.434
PROBLEM OF THE FEDERAL

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:32.337
GOVERNMENT TODAY.

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:33.040
WE HAVE THESE AGENCIES THAT ARE

00:05:32.483 --> 00:05:34.641
COMPLETELY UNGOVERNABLE.

00:05:33.184 --> 00:05:36.059
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE CONVERSATION I

00:05:34.785 --> 00:05:37.345
THINK A CONFIRMATION HEARING

00:05:36.187 --> 00:05:39.345
SHOULD BE ABOUT, RIGHT?

00:05:37.488 --> 00:05:40.691
IT'S NOT GOING TO BE, AT LEAST

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.692
FOR NOW, BECAUSE OF THE FACT

00:05:40.817 --> 00:05:43.449
THAT THE WHITE HOUSE STUDENT

00:05:41.816 --> 00:05:44.695
ABOUT THE GUY AND THESE OTHER

00:05:43.594 --> 00:05:46.397
