00:05:44.802 --> 00:05:47.899
IT GOES TO YOUR POINT, RIGHT,

00:05:46.502 --> 00:05:49.105
THEY ARE NOT LOOKING BOTH WAYS

00:05:49.255 --> 00:05:53.212
THEY ARE CREATING --

00:05:51.357 --> 00:05:56.661
&gt;&gt; Bret: THIS IS NOT ACCURATE.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:57.562
LET'S LISTEN TO SENATOR TESTER,

00:05:56.807 --> 00:05:59.490
ANOTHER SOUND BITE IN HIS

00:05:57.708 --> 00:06:00.818
