00:06:10.074 --> 00:06:14.225
BECAUSE HE HAD BEEN DRINKING SO

00:06:10.951 --> 00:06:17.028
MUCH.

00:06:14.329 --> 00:06:18.429
THE STUFF HAPPENED MOSTLY DURING

00:06:17.131 --> 00:06:19.474
