00:06:18.558 --> 00:06:20.135
PRESIDENT OBAMA.

00:06:19.586 --> 00:06:21.988
I DON'T THINK PRESIDENT OBAMA

00:06:20.285 --> 00:06:24.335
WAS AWARE OF THE STUFF OR HE

00:06:22.133 --> 00:06:24.835
WOULDN'T HAVE TOLERATED IT IF IT

00:06:24.441 --> 00:06:27.445
