00:06:24.942 --> 00:06:30.441
&gt;&gt; Bret: SO WHICH ONE IS THAT,

00:06:27.593 --> 00:06:31.143
THEY CALL HIM THE CANDYMAN?

00:06:30.581 --> 00:06:33.498
OCTOBER 2016, THE PRESIDENT

00:06:31.331 --> 00:06:35.746
WRITES "RONNIE DOES A GREAT JOB,

00:06:33.644 --> 00:06:38.834
GENUINE ENTHUSIASM, POISE UNDER

00:06:35.849 --> 00:06:41.008
PRESSURE, INCREDIBLE WORK ETHIC.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.408
RONNIE CONTINUES TO INSPIRE

00:06:41.152 --> 00:06:44.855
CONFIDENCE.

00:06:42.553 --> 00:06:45.156
CONTINUE TO PROMOTE AHEAD OF

00:06:44.963 --> 00:06:45.612
PEERS.

00:06:45.282 --> 00:06:49.360
WHICH ONE IS IT?

00:06:45.756 --> 00:06:49.660
EITHER THEY DON'T KNOW OR THEY

00:06:49.465 --> 00:06:51.362
