00:07:20.546 --> 00:07:24.550
I'M NOT JUST GOING TO GO, IT'S

00:07:23.594 --> 00:07:27.554
ALLEGED, AND I AM HEARING THAT

00:07:24.695 --> 00:07:29.007
THIS GUY DID ALL OF THESE

00:07:28.156 --> 00:07:31.406
TERRIBLE THINGS, X, Y, AND Z.

00:07:29.153 --> 00:07:32.259
BECAUSE I HAVE NO IDEA IF IT'S

00:07:31.556 --> 00:07:35.681
TRUE OR NOT.

00:07:32.403 --> 00:07:36.607
CLEARLY NEITHER DOES JON TESTER.

00:07:35.806 --> 00:07:38.683
IT'S A PROBLEM.

00:07:36.713 --> 00:07:40.216
&gt;&gt; Bret: THE WHITE HOUSE SAYS

00:07:38.809 --> 00:07:41.185
THEY CALLED HIM THE CANDYMAN BUT

