00:07:44.369 --> 00:07:46.817
THESE GLOWING -- AT THE END OF

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:51.047
THE ADMINISTRATION.

00:07:46.953 --> 00:07:53.124
THERE IS A DISCONNECT HERE.

00:07:51.178 --> 00:07:55.684
CLEARLY THIS IS A GUY WHO HAS

00:07:53.229 --> 00:07:56.633
A STERLING REPUTATION, A LOT AT

00:07:55.826 --> 00:07:58.184
STAKE.

