WE SAW THE SOMEWHAT HUMOROUS

00:07:59.136 --> 00:08:01.136
RESPONSE FROM PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:07:59.837 --> 00:08:03.057
WHEN HE WAS ASKED ABOUT WHETHER

00:08:01.308 --> 00:08:04.241
HE STOOD BEHIND RONNY JACKSON

00:08:03.189 --> 00:08:04.991
AND HE SAID I DON'T KNOW IF I

00:08:04.392 --> 00:08:07.838
WOULD GO FORWARD WITH IT IF I

00:08:05.136 --> 00:08:09.093
WERE HIM.

00:08:07.945 --> 00:08:12.543
IN WASHINGTON SPEAK, EVERYONE

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:12.999
WAS LIKE OH, HE IS NOT BACKING

00:08:12.649 --> 00:08:15.151
RONNY JACKSON.

00:08:13.144 --> 00:08:15.471
&gt;&gt; Bret: THAT'S EXACTLY WHAT I

00:08:15.301 --> 00:08:18.449
SAID.

00:08:16.347 --> 00:08:19.650
&gt;&gt; BUT IF YOU THINK ABOUT

00:08:18.554 --> 00:08:21.552
DONALD TRUMP AND THE WAY HE

00:08:19.757 --> 00:08:22.478
REACTS AND, HE DOESN'T SPEAK

00:08:21.657 --> 00:08:23.754
WASHINGTON SPEAK.

00:08:22.608 --> 00:08:27.058
HE WAS JUST TRYING TO SAY YOU

00:08:23.861 --> 00:08:28.259
HAVE THIS GOOD GUY GETTING

00:08:27.165 --> 00:08:30.165
DRAGGED THROUGH THE MUD.

00:08:28.365 --> 00:08:32.663
HE LOOKS GREAT IN A UNIFORM.

00:08:30.346 --> 00:08:33.418
I DON'T KNOW WHY -- AND THEN HE

00:08:32.963 --> 00:08:35.071
HAD THAT MOMENT --

00:08:33.564 --> 00:08:37.445
&gt;&gt; HE ALSO SAID IT'S GOING TO BE

00:08:35.221 --> 00:08:38.169
UP TO RONNY JACKSON TO DECIDE

00:08:37.568 --> 00:08:38.769
WHETHER OR NOT THE CONFIRMATION

00:08:38.274 --> 00:08:41.449
GOES FORWARD.

00:08:38.874 --> 00:08:42.202
I AGREE WITH YOU, THE FIRST

00:08:41.572 --> 00:08:43.674
MIGHT BE LIGHTHEARTED AND FUN

00:08:42.328 --> 00:08:44.951
BUT THAT'S A PRETTY CLEAR THING

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:47.411
TO SAY ONLY RONNY JACKSON WILL

00:08:45.076 --> 00:08:47.732
DECIDE WHETHER OR NOT IT GOES

00:08:47.532 --> 00:08:49.436
FORWARD.

00:08:47.878 --> 00:08:49.834
THAT'S LESS OF A RINGING

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:51.301
ENDORSEMENT.

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:53.684
THAT'S THE PRESIDENT SAYING

